    "body": "Hi @annevk, thanks for your review! There are already a couple WPT tests about the interaction of autofocus with the permissions policy here:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/blob/master/permissions-policy/experimental-features/focus-without-user-activation-disabled.html\r\nhttps://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/blob/master/permissions-policy/experimental-features/focus-without-user-activation-enabled.sub.html\r\n\r\nDo you think this is enough coverage?\r\n\r\n(btw thanks for mentioning the organization issue, I'm in the process of adding it)",
